    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s1_cand_b",
      "x": 178,
      "y": 882,
      "width": 630,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "• Name similarity          • Address similarity\n• City / Postcode keys     • TF-IDF / BM25 retrieval\n• Char n-gram + ANN (faiss / hnswlib)\n• Partition by COUNTRY first — 0 cross-country matches\n\n  Union of name-blocker AND address-blocker is REQUIRED:\n  14.8% of true pairs share NO name token.",
      "originalText": "• Name similarity          • Address similarity\n• City / Postcode keys     • TF-IDF / BM25 retrieval\n• Char n-gram + ANN (faiss / hnswlib)\n• Partition by COUNTRY first — 0 cross-country matches\n\n  Union of name-blocker AND address-blocker is REQUIRED:\n  14.8% of true pairs share NO name token.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
