      "x": 178,
      "y": 1638,
      "width": 630,
      "height": 170,
      "text": "• Name similarity            • Address similarity\n• Jaccard similarity         • Levenshtein / edit similarity\n• TF-IDF cosine similarity   • Char n-gram overlap\n• City match                 • Postal-code match\n• Phone similarity           • Country match  ← constant, drop\n\n  Computed for EVERY candidate pair, match or not.",
      "originalText": "• Name similarity            • Address similarity\n• Jaccard similarity         • Levenshtein / edit similarity\n• TF-IDF cosine similarity   • Char n-gram overlap\n• City match                 • Postal-code match\n• Phone similarity           • Country match  ← constant, drop\n\n  Computed for EVERY candidate pair, match or not.",
