      "x": 1190,
      "y": 2112,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "• Precision        • Recall        • F1\n• COMPETITION METRIC:  macro-averaged F₀.₅   (precision weighted 2×)\n     F₀.₅ = (1.25 × P × R) / (0.25 × P + R)   — computed per S1 entity, then averaged\n     singletons included: correct empty prediction scores 1.0",
      "originalText": "• Precision        • Recall        • F1\n• COMPETITION METRIC:  macro-averaged F₀.₅   (precision weighted 2×)\n     F₀.₅ = (1.25 × P × R) / (0.25 × P + R)   — computed per S1 entity, then averaged\n     singletons included: correct empty prediction scores 1.0",
